      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "A bus company planned to remove an evening route because passenger numbers were low. At first, the timetable seemed to support the decision. Yet a student named Ella noticed that the final bus left before several evening classes ended. She wondered whether the service was measuring demand fairly.",
