      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Ella collected comments from commuters and checked the route's frequency. Some passengers had missed a connection because the buses arrived late. If the company had changed the timetable earlier, more people might have used the service. However, Ella knew that this was a possibility, not a proven result.",
        "zh": "艾拉收集了通勤者意见，检查发车频率。有些乘客因公交晚点错过了换乘。如果公司早些调整时刻表，或许会有更多人使用这条线路。不过，艾拉知道这只是一种可能，尚未得到证实。",
