      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The company agreed to a short trial. It adjusted the departure time and improved the interchange signs. A subsidy covered part of the initial cost, while the council monitored congestion near the college. The team compared passenger totals with those from similar weeks, rather than using a single busy evening.",
        "zh": "公司同意短期试行，调整了发车时间，并改善换乘标识。一项补助承担了部分初期费用，地方议会则监测学院附近的拥堵情况。团队把乘客总量与相似周次比较，没有只看某个繁忙晚上。",
        "start": 104.71333333333334,
        "voiceEnd": 130.64333333333335,
        "end": 156.57333333333332,
